From d1ac3a1a60608de7b41d1c616e49b210d7438aa0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Craterbrain <58347640+Craterbrain@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 20:47:27 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 25/75] PlaitOS: adapt double tap to sleep to GrapheneOS

- Switch is Settings.System plait_double_tap_to_sleep (default off), read
  for the current user on the double tap itself instead of through two
  observers that only saw the system user's value
- No lineage-sdk config default; drop the now unused observer plumbing

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../NotificationPanelViewController.java      | 28 ++++-------------
 .../systemui/shade/QQSGestureListener.kt      | 30 ++++++++-----------
 2 files changed, 19 insertions(+), 39 deletions(-)

diff --git a/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/shade/NotificationPanelViewController.java b/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/shade/NotificationPanelViewController.java
index 90f9eeb18..e6a7eced5 100644
--- a/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/shade/NotificationPanelViewController.java
+++ b/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/shade/NotificationPanelViewController.java
